 the listed companies. This includes business registration numbers, revenue for 2024 and 2025, employee counts, and contact information. The data will be extracted from the given source details for each company.\n\n\nBusiness registration numbers, revenue data, employee counts, and contact details are being extracted and populated for each company listed, based on the provided source information. Data inconsistencies or missing entries are being addressed by cross-referencing Bizno, Cookiedeal, MoneyPin, Naver Map, Kakao Map and other sources to ensure the highest-confidence data integrity. The updated information is being clearly indicated for easy identification and review.\n\n\nPopulating the missing data for the listed companies, I'm extracting and verifying information such as business registration numbers, revenue, employee counts, and contact details from the provided sources. Using the cross-referencing process to validate business registration numbers, I'm also ensuring the address accuracy by prioritizing Cookiedeal's information. The next step is to fill the remaining blanks based on the data.\n\n\nBusiness data for \"김동칠,\" \"모두싸인,\" \"아신홀딩스,\" and \"(주)투판즈 부산지점\" is being incorporated into the dataset, including registration numbers, revenue, employee counts, and contact information. Data is being cross-validated against various source mentions, with priority given to Cookiedeal for address accuracy and MoneyPin for business specifics.\n\nA potential discrepancy in the address for 아신홀딩스 is being noted, with cross-referencing underway to reconcile the \"쿠키딜 기준\" address against other sources to achieve a validated standard. All new additions are now marked to simplify the review process.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\nconst targets = JSON.parse(\n  fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/a97462f9-3976-4927-b799-281f20134eb3/scratch/blue_missing_sales_targets.json', 'utf8')\n