{"step_index":1168,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T00:31:14Z","thinking":"Examining the provided corporate data. The focus is on identifying key information within each row, such as company name, business registration number, representative's name, and address. Extracting these details to understand the scope and nature of the entities listed.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const xlsx = require('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/add_undo_game_studio/node_modules/exceljs');\n\nasync function searchBizno500() {\n  const biznoPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today/비즈노_500개_기업정보_16개열_정제완료.xlsx';\n  const wb = new xlsx.Workbook();\n  await wb.xlsx.readFile(biznoPath);\n  const ws = wb.worksheets[0];\n\n  console.log(`Searching 500 bizno file (Rows: ${ws.rowCount})...`);\n  const names = ['토탈소프트뱅크', '센디', '페이타랩', '칸투칸', '쉐어트리츠', '케어닥', '모두싸인', '라온엔터테인먼트', '네오테크놀러지', '우리누리', '씨소프트', '도원이앤아이', '제이더블유하비', '투판즈'];\n\n  for (let r = 2; r <= ws.rowCount; r++) {\n    const row = ws.getRow(r);\n    const compName = String(row.getCell(2).value || '');\n    const bizNo = String(row.getCell(3).value || '');\n    const ceo = String(row.getCell(4).value || '');\n    const addr = String(row.getCell(6).value || '');\n    const phone = String(row.getCell(7).value || '');\n    const emp = row.getCell(11).value;\n\n    for (const target of names) {\n      if (compName.includes(target)) {\n        console.log(`Found in Bizno 500! [${compName}] Biz: ${bizNo} | CEO: ${ceo} | Phone: ${phone} | Addr: ${addr} | Emp: ${emp}`);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nsearchBizno500().catch(console.error);\n","Description":"Search bizno 500 file for target companies","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a97462f9-3976-4927-b799-281f20134eb3\\scratch\\search_bizno_500.js","toolAction":"Writing script to search bizno 500","toolSummary":"Write search_bizno_500.js"}}]}
